cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "agreeR: Agreement Analysis for Method Comparison Studies"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
authors:
  - family-names: Guppy
    given-names: Stuart
    email: sguppy-91@users.noreply.github.com
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sguppy-91/agreeR"
url: "https://github.com/sguppy-91/agreeR"
abstract: >-
  agreeR estimates agreement between two measurement methods using
  Bland-Altman limits of agreement, ordinary least products regression,
  and equivalence testing (TOST). Designed for single-measurement,
  per-subject method comparison studies common in sport and exercise
  science.
keywords:
  - R
  - agreement analysis
  - method comparison
  - Bland-Altman
  - limits of agreement
  - equivalence testing
